  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.39 with immutable ProGPU preview.45; consumes compact retained-picture commands, classified transforms, pooled transient command storage, retained text-position reuse, reusable immutable-image edge geometry, and validated explicit reservations without a bridge workaround; preserves the typed, zero-allocation ProGPU media drawing-state bridge, native activation, deterministic popup-local input, transparent X11/XWayland visuals, and nonactivating windows; bounds retained render-resource caches and suppresses static-frame GPU rendering; and retains native Cocoa popups, Windows OLE clipboard, seven-theme, WPFGallery, and SharpDevelop designer acceptance gates.",
